{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33357","headline":"咏酒 · 翁绶","name":"咏酒","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"逃暑迎春复送秋，无非绿蚁满杯浮。\n百年莫惜千回醉，一醆能消万古愁。\n几爲芳菲眠细草，曾因雨雪上高楼。\n平生名利关身者，不识狂歌到白头。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"翁绶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33357.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33357","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}